# =============================================================================
# SEQUENTIAL COPULA-CNN-LSTM DQN WITH UNCERTAINTY-WEIGHTED EXPERIENCE REPLAY
# =============================================================================
#
# Controlled pseudo-temporal sequential decision-making benchmark
#
# Datasets:
#   1. Boston Housing
#   2. Wine Quality Red
#
# Methods:
#   1. Uniform Experience Replay
#   2. Q-Dispersion Uncertainty-Weighted Replay
#
# Core sequential structure:
#
#       S_t  -->  A_t  -->  R_t
#          \             \
#           \             --> S_{t+1}
#
# Bellman target:
#
#       y_t = r_t +
#             gamma * (1-d_t) * max_a Q_target(S_{t+1},a)
#
# Important:
# The Boston and Wine covariates are transformed into controlled
# pseudo-temporal state trajectories. This is therefore a benchmark
# environment, not naturally observed longitudinal data.
#
# =============================================================================


